ami","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/textCase(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/textCase(_:)","role":"symbol","title":"textCase(_:)","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/textcase(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"textCase","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Case","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV4CaseO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic"}}}